# Discord Social SDK: no longer committed (was blowing through GitHub's LFS
# bandwidth budget — 745MB of debug/iOS/Android binaries this project never
# builds, re-downloaded in full by 3 parallel CI jobs on every run). CI fetches
# a lean, release-only re-host from m.doughmination.gay instead — see
# release.yml. For local dev, download the SDK from the Discord Developer
# Portal and unzip it here, or grab the lean re-host from the same CDN URL.
